  "narration": {
    "pattern_romaji": "A mo B desu",
    "pattern_jp": "AもBです",
    "pattern_english": "A is also B / A is B, too",
    "slots": [
      {
        "slot": "A",
        "fits": "The topic that is 'also' true: a person (わたし, ゆき), a thing, a day (にちようび), or a の-chunk like わたしのよてい. も replaces は here."
      },
      {
        "slot": "B",
        "fits": "A noun that was already said about something else: a day off (やすみ), a movie (えいが), a place (えき)."
      }
    ],
    "segments": [
      {
        "kind": "en",
        "speaker": "A",
        "speed": "teaching",
        "text": "Welcome back! Today's pattern is {AもBです}. It means: A is also B. Or: A is B, too."
      },
      {
        "kind": "en",
        "speaker": "A",
        "speed": "teaching",
        "text": "The only new piece is one tiny word: {も}. It means also, or too."
      },
      {
        "kind": "jp",
        "speaker": "A",
        "speed": "teaching",
        "text": "わたしもやすみです。"
      },
      {
        "kind": "en",
        "speaker": "A",
        "speed": "teaching",
        "text": "That means: I'm off too."
      },
      {
        "kind": "en",
        "speaker": "A",
        "speed": "teaching",
        "text": "Here are the slots. A is the topic: a person, a thing, a day. B is the noun you're saying about it. And {も} sits exactly where {は} used to sit."
      },
      {
        "kind": "en",
        "speaker": "A",
        "speed": "teaching",
        "text": "So {も} doesn't get added to the sentence. It replaces {は}. Topic, then {も}, then the noun, then {です} last, as always."
      },
      {
        "kind": "en",
        "speaker": "A",
        "speed": "teaching",
        "text": "Notice the word order. In English, also floats in the middle: I am also off. In Japanese, {も} sticks right onto the thing that's also true: I, too, day off, is."
      },
      {
        "kind": "en",
        "speaker": "A",
        "speed": "teaching",
        "text": "Let's build one. Start with the topic {わたし}, meaning I."
      },
      {
        "kind": "jp",
        "speaker": "A",
        "speed": "teaching",
        "text": "わたし"
      },
      {
        "kind": "en",
